the determinant of the linear part times the measure of the set. -/
theorem addHaar_image_affineEquiv (f : F ≃ᵃ[ℝ] F) (s : Set F) :
    μ (f '' s) = ENNReal.ofReal |LinearMap.det (f.linear : F →ₗ[ℝ] F)| * μ s :=
