divided by the exact energy of the test measure. -/
theorem compact_mass_sq_le_energy {R : ℝ} (hR : 0 ≤ R)
    (μ : Measure ℝ) [IsFiniteMeasure μ]
    (hSupport : ∀ᵐ x ∂μ, x ∈ Icc (-R) R) :
