one reads the `i`-th coordinate of its argument off as the `j`-th coordinate of the image. -/
theorem apply_eq_of_map_single {L : EuclideanSpace 𝕜 ι →ₗᵢ[𝕜] EuclideanSpace 𝕜 κ} {i : ι} {j : κ}
